    "lead_id": "city_volunteer_portal:186398",
    "text": "Who We Are: James Logan Elementary School is a Community School. It collaborates with the City of Philadelphia, the School District, community-based organizations, and the residents of Philadelphia to pave the way for student success. | What We Do: Our students are supported by a Community School Coordinator. Volunteers are needed to distribute weekly groceries to students and families, support special events like resource fairs, and more! Click on opportunities to learn more and get involved today. Looking to sign up for Philly Reading Coaches shifts at Logan? Click here instead."
